C20 — Payment

Show payment method, payable amount, provider checkout and payment status. Never collect/store raw card credentials. Support retry without duplicate charge.

C21 — Booking detail

Show status timeline, provider, service, price snapshot, address, item list, scheduled windows, cancellation eligibility and support action.

