FAQs, booking-specific issue categories, ticket creation, attachments and ticket status.

C30 — Notifications

List alerts with read/unread state and deep links to relevant booking.

C31 — Profile and preferences

Edit name/email, notification preferences, saved addresses, language if supported and account controls.

C32 — Privacy and account controls

